  "description": "Bring delicate romance, poetic charm, and handcrafted grace to your creative designs with Briellea, a brand new calligraphy script font. Featuring sweeping swashes, elegant handwritten loops, and a smooth, organic flow, Briellea adds an intimate, high-end, and artistic touch to every visual project. Set against a misty, glass-window backdrop with soft rainy aesthetics and vibrant blooming flowers, Briellea is the perfect choice for wedding stationery, romantic invitations, luxury fashion branding, photography watermarks, cosmetics packaging, aesthetic social media graphics, boutique logos, and chic editorial layouts.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring delicate romance, poetic charm, and handcrafted grace to your creative designs with Briellea, a brand new calligraphy script font. Featuring sweeping swashes, elegant handwritten loops, and a smooth, organic flow, Briellea adds an intimate, high-end, and artistic touch to every visual project. Set against a misty, glass-window backdrop with soft rainy aesthetics and vibrant blooming flowers, Briellea is the perfect choice for wedding stationery, romantic invitations, luxury fashion branding, photography watermarks, cosmetics packaging, aesthetic social media graphics, boutique logos, and chic editorial layouts.</p>",
